{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GrafluentCollections\/documentation\/GrafluentCollections"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","externalID":"GrafluentCollections","modules":[{"name":"GrafluentCollections"}],"title":"GrafluentCollections","symbolKind":"module"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Graph-shaped collections for Swift: search trees, tries, suffix structures and decision diagrams"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with value semantics, built on Grafluent."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every collection is a copy-on-write struct with the API shape of the standard library’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"collections and Swift Collections. Where a structure is a tree or a graph, it also converts to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Grafluent type of that shape (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BinaryTree"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Arborescence"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RootedTree"},{"text":"), so Grafluent’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"algorithms and drawings run over it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import GrafluentCollections"},{"text":" imports every module. Each module also has its own documentation and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can be imported on its own.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import GrafluentCollections","","var scores: FenwickTree = [3, 1, 4, 1, 5, 9, 2, 6]","print(scores.prefixSum(through: 3))  \/\/ 9","print(scores.sum(in: 2 ..< 6))       \/\/ 19"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documen